{"repositoryId":335135678,"availability":"available","full":"rydmike/theme_demo","name":"theme_demo","description":"Persisted theme demo with FlexColorScheme and Riverpod","category":"Design","language":"Dart","stars":68,"forks":12,"created":"2021-02-02T01:41:10Z","updated":"2023-08-08T22:32:11Z","license":"BSD-3-Clause","branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":["flexcolorscheme","flutter","material-design","riverpod","theme","togglebuttons"],"demo":"https://rydmike.com/flexcolorscheme/themesplayground-v7/#/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T08:21:56.548Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T08:21:56.548Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T08:21:56.548Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T08:21:56.548Z","stars":68,"forks":12}],"technologies":["Flutter"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This Flutter application shows how to use FlexColorScheme together with Riverpod to dynamically change your application theme. It uses Riverpod providers to watch FlexColorScheme based light theme and darkTheme changes in a MaterialApp, and to change the used themeMode as well.","The theme settings are persisted locally as they are modified. The used local settings persistence implementation can be changed via the application's user interface. It would be straight forward to also add persistence implementations that use cloud-based services.","The app is used primary to demonstrate FlexColorScheme and Riverpod concepts, and to provide usage suggestions. It is not intended to look extremely beautiful or be very useful as an app."],"features":["The demo UI uses several ToggleButtons based widgets as well as SwitchListTile, Slider.adaptive and PopupMenuButton, to compose UI widgets used to change several input values for the used and demonstrated…","The app demonstrates how the ThemeData, and ThemeMode states of the application can be easily managed using Riverpod, together with Providers and NotifierProviders. The providers are used to provide the current…","It also shows how simple it is to make small UI theme control widgets that can be dropped in anywhere, were needed in an app, and then used to manipulate and modify the ThemeData of the application. The UI view widgets…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rydmike/theme_demo/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"ba7b6680d3473855cc5f334b3d83c11ccd6392d6b4a5e3884f81d4eacaf67835","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T08:21:56.714Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T08:21:56.714Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This Flutter application shows how to use FlexColorScheme together with Riverpod to dynamically change your application theme. It uses Riverpod providers to watch FlexColorScheme based light theme and darkTheme changes in a MaterialApp, and to change the used themeMode as well.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rydmike/theme_demo/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ba7b6680d3473855cc5f334b3d83c11ccd6392d6b4a5e3884f81d4eacaf67835","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rydmike/theme_demo/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T08:21:56.716Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2023-08-08T22:32:11Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rydmike/theme_demo/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T08:21:56.721Z","hash":"ba7b6680d3473855cc5f334b3d83c11ccd6392d6b4a5e3884f81d4eacaf67835","originalBytes":76275,"storedBytes":76275,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["flutter","value","get","theme","used","key-value","settings","provider","new","hive","key","bool","state","app","return","when","final","keyvaluedb","prefs","using","implementation","see","change","ref.watch","thememode","type","const","light","case","debug","themedata","application","dark","flexcolorscheme","int","false","providers","riverpod","widget","null","set","switch","init","defaultvalue","old","class","keyvaluedbprovider","only","required","above","dart","just","ref.read","value.","widgets","debugprint","default","implementa